  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1115847,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1-Bit Escape: A Game Boy Puzzle Adventure\n\nTrapped within a stark, monochromatic room, you must unravel the mysteries of *1-Bit Escape* for the Nintendo Game Boy. This unique escape room game challenges you to break free from a minimalist prison, relying on your wits and observation skills to succeed. \n\nThe narrative is sparse, leaving you to piece together the story through environmental clues and cryptic puzzles. The game's aesthetic is deliberately limited, utilizing the Game Boy's monochrome palette to create a sense of isolation and claustrophobia. \n\nGameplay revolves around interacting with the environment, manipulating objects, and solving logic puzzles. Expect pixelated visuals, chiptune music, and a surprisingly deep level of challenge. Each action has consequences, and careful planning is essential to avoid dead ends.  Discover hidden mechanisms, decipher coded messages, and ultimately, find the key to unlock your freedom. *1-Bit Escape* is a testament to the ingenuity of puzzle game design, proving that compelling gameplay doesn't require lavish graphics."
    },
